(936, 133, 18, '<p>Manual EIE editorial Paraninfo.</p>\r\n<p>Manual EIE editorial Editex.</p>\r\n<p>Manual EIE editorial McMillan.</p>\r\n<p>Manual EIE editorial Mc Graw Hill.</p>'),
