48.4px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.806228);">contrastada en medios digitales como, por ejemplo, redes sociales, bancos de </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 762.566px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.770498);">sonidos, p&aacute;ginas web especializadas, diccionarios y enciclopedias en l&iacute;nea, bases </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 776.733px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.80371);">de datos especializadas...</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790891);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790142);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 703.412px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.776042);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 175.652px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 776.733px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.80371);"> La informaci&oacute;n se registrar&aacute; en papel de forma cui</span><span style="left: 444.823px; top: 776.733px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif;">-</span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 790.9px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; tran