font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 904.233px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.83193);">Uso de las herramientas m&aacute;s comunes de las TIC para colaborar y comuni</span><span style="left: 444.781px; top: 904.233px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif;">-</span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 918.4px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.826222);">carse con el resto del grupo con el fin de planificar el trabajo, aportar ideas </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 932.566px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.7949);">constructivas propias, comprender las ideas ajenas...; compartir informaci&oacute;n y </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 946.733px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.77897);">recursos, y construir un producto o meta colectivo. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790891);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790142);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 703.412px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.776042);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 175.652px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 946.733px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.77897);">Correo electr&oacute;nico. M&oacute;dulos </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 960.9px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.791877);">cooperativos en entornos personales de aprendizaje. Servicios de la web social </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 975.066px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.818247);">como blogs, sitios wiki, foros... </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790891);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790142);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 703.412px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.776042);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 175.652px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 975.066px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.818247);">H&aacute;bitos y conductas en la comunicaci&oacute;n y en </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 989.233px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.792907);">la protecci&oacute;n del propio individuo y de los otros de las malas pr&aacute;cticas como el </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1003.4px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.785219);">ciberacoso.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790891);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790142);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 703.412px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.776042);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 175.652px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1017.57px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.785923);">An&aacute;lisis del p&uacute;blico destinatario y adaptaci&oacute;n de la comunicaci&oacute;n en funci&oacute;n de </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.73px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796177);">este. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790891);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.790142);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 703.412px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.776042);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 175.652px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796252);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 896.345px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79337);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 192.719px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.787178);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.73px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.796177);">H&aacute;bitos y conductas para filtrar la fuente de informaci&oacute;n m&aacute;s completa y </span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1045.9px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.782673);">compartirla con el grupo.</span><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1060.07px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.7909);">Asunci&oacute;n de varios roles en equipos de trabajo. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 226.053px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.801771);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 991.745px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.795444);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1031.67px; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: serif; transform: scaleX(0.79066);"><span style="left: 52.1768px; top: 1347.35px; font-size